      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sounds like significant changes, and I appreciate the heads up on this transition. To confirm, can you provide more information on the timeline for the migration and decommissioning of the current architecture, such as when I can expect downtime and what resources will be available for troubleshooting? Additionally, are there any plans for training on the new rule-based diagnostic engine in place of the probabilistic models?",
